{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00235",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 4.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I've settled them in, ready when you are."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.71,
      "end_seconds": 9.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Great. Hello, come in and sit down. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 10.32,
      "end_seconds": 13.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.16,
      "end_seconds": 17.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.52,
      "end_seconds": 23.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Yeah, it's a ring-shaped itchy patch. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.98,
      "end_seconds": 29.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.23,
      "end_seconds": 32.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "I've had it since last weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.37,
      "end_seconds": 35.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Have you had itching in the groin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.19,
      "end_seconds": 41.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "Mm, yes. I've also had darker skin around the patch, since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.31,
      "end_seconds": 44.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Has there been scaly, peeling skin too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.7,
      "end_seconds": 49.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.44,
      "end_seconds": 51.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.85,
      "end_seconds": 56.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.87,
      "end_seconds": 59.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Have you had any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.77,
      "end_seconds": 61.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "No. No fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 63.08,
      "end_seconds": 66.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice fever. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.96,
      "end_seconds": 73.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.75,
      "end_seconds": 83.17,
      "duration_seconds": 8.42,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Any similar rash on the scalp, pain or new partner at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.73,
      "end_seconds": 89.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "I haven't had similar rash on the scalp, pain or new partner, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.24,
      "end_seconds": 94.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Okay, what about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.97,
      "end_seconds": 96.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.62,
      "end_seconds": 98.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.36,
      "end_seconds": 100.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.82,
      "end_seconds": 105.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Bear with me, I need to finish this line in the notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.34,
      "end_seconds": 128.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "That's saved, thanks for waiting. Alright, any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.08,
      "end_seconds": 132.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I've had diabetes for about ten years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.71,
      "end_seconds": 133.7,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.2,
      "end_seconds": 137.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Yes, high blood pressure. Yes, migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.19,
      "end_seconds": 146.42,
      "duration_seconds": 8.23,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. Okay, yes, I can see the diabetes in your file as well. Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.24,
      "end_seconds": 150.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.41,
      "end_seconds": 151.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.99,
      "end_seconds": 156.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.65,
      "end_seconds": 159.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.82,
      "end_seconds": 163.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.09,
      "end_seconds": 168.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.77,
      "end_seconds": 171.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "My father was diabetic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.8,
      "end_seconds": 174.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.21,
      "end_seconds": 180.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Yes, I had cataract surgery on my right eye, last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.18,
      "end_seconds": 183.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.75,
      "end_seconds": 185.62,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.9,
      "end_seconds": 189.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.47,
      "end_seconds": 191.32,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.72,
      "end_seconds": 203.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 208.01,
      "end_seconds": 223.48,
      "duration_seconds": 15.47,
      "text": "Right, it's glimepiride, 2 milligrams, before breakfast for my sugar, doctor. He is on amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day for my pressure, I give it to him. He takes sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.19,
      "end_seconds": 226.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 227.48,
      "end_seconds": 228.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "For about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.71,
      "end_seconds": 233.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I used to take Glycomet, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 234.41,
      "end_seconds": 242.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. BP is 108 over 72, temperature is 36.5 degrees, pulse is 75 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.65,
      "end_seconds": 246.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Thanks. How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.64,
      "end_seconds": 256.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.43,
      "text": "Right, busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.21,
      "end_seconds": 261.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.52,
      "end_seconds": 265.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Turn your head to the side for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.28,
      "end_seconds": 288.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "There's a red ring-shaped scaly patch with a clearer centre in the groin crease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.15,
      "end_seconds": 289.98,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "Yes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.99,
      "end_seconds": 293.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.56,
      "end_seconds": 308.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Skin between the toes is white and peeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.09,
      "end_seconds": 316.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Okay, has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.27,
      "end_seconds": 331.08,
      "duration_seconds": 13.81,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.69,
      "end_seconds": 345.1,
      "duration_seconds": 13.41,
      "text": "Putting it all together, it fits best with a fungal skin infection. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. It could also be psoriasis, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.24,
      "end_seconds": 348.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.87,
      "end_seconds": 366.44,
      "duration_seconds": 17.57,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a fungal skin infection, and we'll know more once the a skin scraping is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a ring-shaped itchy patch, since last weekend, and no new partner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.01,
      "end_seconds": 369.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.13,
      "end_seconds": 383.72,
      "duration_seconds": 13.59,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.86,
      "end_seconds": 386.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 387.98,
      "end_seconds": 414.23,
      "duration_seconds": 26.25,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a skin scraping for suspected fungal infection. I'll start you on terbinafine cream, once a day, for two weeks. That's for fungal infection. Keep the area dry, wear loose cotton, and don't share towels. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 415.3,
      "end_seconds": 416.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 416.38,
      "end_seconds": 418.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Let's review you in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 419.73,
      "end_seconds": 423.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 423.95,
      "end_seconds": 430.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 431.28,
      "end_seconds": 438.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "So, I take the terbinafine cream, once a day and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 438.82,
      "end_seconds": 444.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 445.94,
      "end_seconds": 450.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Um, okay, thank you. I'll get started on all of that."
    }
  ]
}